Cell["The spatial family: ArrayGraphics3D", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"24b3cfd3-7672-ac4b-a880-d8845d4cd1c0"],

Cell["\<\
The same arrays, as cubes arranged in space. At order one a line of cubes, at \
order two a plane of them:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f4d53678-689f-014a-aad3-08379da6c1e4"],

